{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ccd4ad9f2d98d1c5283e5d40f3b1294bc3f48f20e6e8202e5f4d77ec1f3347c7", "ja": "そ、そうだな。\nファンもぐいぐい増えると思う！", "zh": "这、这个嘛，\n我觉得粉丝会火速增加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
