{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "7c52528d4557285f50d8021660f51906ff79bb52de654cc2d1e579c50ca0430a", "ja": "ほらほら、こんなトコとか～、こ～んなトコとか！\nゆ～っくり、た～っぷり、ミキを見てね？", "zh": "你看你看，比方说这里～还有这里～之类的！\n你就慢慢地～仔细地～把美希看个够吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a34cdb266484ee31b2cc1d888900c31186c113627ec859c4a93a64c54e319cb", "ja": "ハニーには、ミキのぜんぶを見て欲しいって思うな♪", "zh": "美希希望，HONEY可以看着美希的一切♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0f13f07f04840437ba333acb8900c63bebc4770623d23e49c2e513c10aa79091", "ja": "わ……、わかった、ありがとう美希！\n見たよ、じゅうぶん見た！", "zh": "我……我知道了，谢谢美希！\n我看了，已经看得够仔细了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e3b3d0b41920125bdcfbc615883d43941ec04314a99030f89bbc5961aad44fc", "ja": "ふう……。そうだな、美希をぐいぐい好きになった。\n衣装を作って良かったよ。", "zh": "呼……我确实火热爱上美希了。\n做了这套服装真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "982c4edbc42871c4094b689b3554412ab6444ae517a7904fcb616b434f27d0d3", "ja": "やったやったやったぁ！\nじゃあじゃあ、今夜はミキとデートね☆", "zh": "太好了、太好了、太好了！\n那么那么，今晚要跟美希约会唷☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "76db8365ec8bd6183611833ebc82b9e41126de28d98dc090636606f8a19fe375", "ja": "いや、その前に！　その衣装を作ってもらった目的を、\nまずは果たさないと。", "zh": "不，在那之前！\n要先达成制作这套服装的目的才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "1d6ba5324b3233fe10f4b6e00a16f62f707d870d7fe8f36e253c0010114f3b7d", "ja": "もくてき？", "zh": "目的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7dd76ffe4624f6e5a29346200b7c1fe541deb2df70a4b7569a43b434a42aa1f6", "ja": "そう。衣装は俺じゃなくて、ファンに見てもらうために\n作ったんだ。だから……。", "zh": "没错，服装做出来不是要给我看，\n而是要给粉丝看的，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "462c79fd99e22a03c3422d8c9bd14c3609578bc9cb52fd4282de4cd418811838", "ja": "そのかわいい姿を、ファンにもしっかり見せること！\nデートはその後だ。わかったな？", "zh": "也要让粉丝好好欣赏可爱的你！\n约会等到那之后再说，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0084_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "b81259ccaf0b684c2e889d6c819d275314a058a755b0d6a544cbe30b44e44634", "ja": "わかったの！\nじゃあ、これからデートね☆　どこにいく？", "zh": "知道了！\n那接下来就去约会吧☆要去哪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
